.Dd March 31, 2025
.Dt JSON_RECURSE 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm json_recurse
.Nd recurse over a JSON value tree
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In json.h
.Ft void
.Fn json_recurse "jsonval *val" "void (*fn)()" "void *arg"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn json_recurse
function traverses the JSON value tree rooted at
.Fa val
in a depth-first manner, invoking the callback function
.Fa fn
for each node encountered.
The callback receives the current node, the user-supplied pointer
.Fa arg ,
and the current recursion depth.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr json_free 3